{title: Khat Tukde Tukde}
{artist: Sardool Sikander}
{key: C}

{c: Verse 1}
[C] Ve jah bedarda is dil vichon,        [C] Teri har ik yaad bhula deni
[F] Main apne sabh armaana nu,        [C] Aaj aap hi teeli la deni
[C] Khat tukre tukre [Gm] kar dene,        Main [C] Fook dena tasveeran nu
[C] Khat tukre tukre [Gm] kar dene,        Main [C] saad dena tasveeran nu
[Am] Jad tu hi nahin [C] tan ki karne,        [Am] Jad tu hi nahin [C] tan ki karne
[F] Ehna kagaz diyan [A#] jageeran nu,        [C] Khat tukre tukre [Gm] kar dene
Main [C] saad dena tasveeran nu,        Main [F] Fook dena [C] tasveeran nu
[C] Asan bachpan wich banayea si,        [A#] Ghar ralke kachi [C] mitti da
[C] Mainu ik ik lafz oh chete a,        [A#] Teri pyar di pehli [C] chithi da
[Am] Main dil de likheya [C] vaaheya e,        [Am] Main dil de likheya [C] vaaheya e
[F] Tere pyar diyan [A#] tehreeran nu,        [C] Khat tukre tukre [Gm] kar dene
Main [C] Fook dena tasveeran nu,        Main [F] saad dena [C] tasveeran nu
[C] Ehna goongian boliyan tasveeran,        [A#] Dukh vande na [C] marjaane de
[C] Ehna nu dard sunaunda san,        [A#] Main rakh ke jagah [C] sirahne de
[Am] Eh hor sagon [C] tadfaundiyan san,        [Am] Eh hor sagon [C] tadfaundiyan san
[F] Mere akhion vehnde [A#] neeran nu,        [C] Khat tukre tukre [Gm] kar dene
Main [C] Fook dena tasveeran nu
